TranslationUnitDecl
|-ClassTemplateDecl A
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl class depth 0 index 0 T
| |-NonTypeTemplateParmDecl 'int' depth 0 index 1 N
| `-CXXRecordDecl struct A definition
|-ClassTemplateDecl B
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 T
| `-CXXRecordDecl struct B definition
|   |-FieldDecl a 'A<T, 3>'
|   `-FieldDecl b 'A<T *, sizeof(T)>'
`-FunctionTemplateDecl f
  |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 T
  `-FunctionDecl f 'A<T, 1> *(A<T, 2> &)'
    `-ParmVarDecl 'A<T, 2> &'
